## 3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)

### 3.1. Goals of EDA

Before any modelling, we need to understand the data:

- How many classes are there?
- How many images per class?
- Are some classes much bigger than others (imbalance)?
- Are there broken files (corrupted, missing, duplicated)?
- What image sizes do we have?

**Why this matters:** if we skip EDA and there are, say, 100 corrupted files, ResNet50 will crash halfway through and we will have wasted hours. EDA is the cheap safety check.

